  "prefLabel": "Sep 103.01 Duties and Responsibilities",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sep 103.01 Duties and Responsibilities. The board shall administer the provisions of RSA 310-A:202-221 which include but are not limited to safeguarding property, to promoting public welfare and maintaining a high standard of integrity, skills, and practice in the profession of septic evaluators in this state.\n\nSource. #13791, eff 10-25-23",
